  "body": "Found by the read-only second read of PR #3108 (comment 7077960142). It is not confirmed by a run.\n\nPR #3108 raises a warning when an Adaptive operation falls back to Offset rings. `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` adds the warning only in the arm for a setup that is not tilted (near line 3366, warning near 3728-3734). The arm for a tilted 3+2 setup (near 3777-3925) does not add it.\n\nIf an Adaptive operation in a 3+2 setup falls back, the toolpath notes say so, but no warning shows. The other safety rules still check the output. The report to the user is not complete.\n\nNecessary work:\n1. Find if an Adaptive operation can run in the tilted arm. Pin it with a test.\n2. If it can: raise the same warning there, from one shared helper.\n\nRefs #3035\n",
